-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8bfaa89-f8c4-4583-9b00-5a0d583d78fd_400x400.jpeg 2x, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gBtv!,w_96,h_96,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8bfaa89-f8c4-4583-9b00-5a0d583d78fd_400x400.jpeg 3x" width="32" height="32" draggable="false" class="img-OACg1c object-fit-cover-u4ReeV pencraft pc-reset"/></picture></div></div></a></div><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-reset"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-4 pc-reset"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-minWidth-0 pc-gap-8 pc-alignItems-center pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-reset line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-15-Psle70 weight-regular-mUq6Gb"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-minWidth-0 pc-gap-8 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-6 pc-reset color-primary-zABazT line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ comment-author-name"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-4 pc-minWidth-0 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset"><span class="pencraft pc-reset ellipsis-Jb8om8 line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-15-Psle70 weight-medium-fw81nC reset-IxiVJZ"><span style="min-width:0;" data-state="closed"><span class="pencraft pc-reset decoration-hover-underline-ClDVRM reset-IxiVJZ"><a href="https://substack.com/profile/19258555-matthew-f-silvers?utm_source=substack-feed-item" showBack data-native="true" class="link-LIBpto">MATTHEW F SILVERS</a></span></span></span></div></div><span style="min-width:0;" data-state="closed"></span><a data-native="true" href="https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/p/brief-independent-investigation-of/comment/331375825" rel="nofollow" title="Sep 7, 2026, 2:35 AM" class="pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s decoration-hover-underline-ClDVRM reset-IxiVJZ"><span class="pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb nowrap-QngyoB reset-IxiVJZ">8d</span></a></div></div></div><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG"></div><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-reset comment-menu-trigger-container triggerContainer-eX588u"><button tabindex="0" type="button" aria-label="Ellipsis" id="radix-P0-89" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft trigger-j08Uop iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonStyle-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_quaternary-kpMibu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ellipsis"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1"></circle></svg></button></div></div><div class="comment-body expanded"><p><span>On September 6, 2026, Jakub Pachocki published an essay whose title captures a problem deeper than ordinary technological risk: *An Alien Mind*.</span></p><p><span>The phrase should not be mistaken for a claim about extraterrestrial life, consciousness, or hostility. Its significance is epistemic.</span></p><p><span>Modern artificial intelligence is produced by a developmental process fundamentally different from the one that produced human minds. It is trained through optimization across enormous computational systems rather than through biological evolution, embodiment, childhood, culture, mortality, and the social development that shape human cognition. Pachocki's argument is that increasingly capable AI therefore cannot safely be assumed to reason, generalize, value, or understand in precisely the ways humans do merely because its behavior frequently resembles ours.</span></p><p><span>This creates a problem constitutional theory has rarely had to confront. The traditional problem of government is the governance of other humans. Humans may disagree violently about values, interests, ideology, religion, or politics, but they nevertheless share a remarkable amount of cognitive architecture — broadly similar emotional systems, physical vulnerability, social needs, lifespans, evolutionary ancestry, and dependence upon a common physical world. The constitutional system was therefore designed around disagreements among minds that were, at a fundamental level, comprehensible to one another.</span></p><p><span>Artificial intelligence breaks that assumption. The question is no longer merely how we constrain powerful actors whose interests may differ from ours. It becomes: how do we constrain powerful forms of intelligence whose internal representations, modes of generalization, and eventual objectives may become increasingly difficult for us to understand at all? That is the Alien Mind Problem.</span></p></div><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-16 pc-paddingTop-8 pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-alignItems-center pc-reset comment-actions withShareButton-hQzuEn"><span class="pencraft pc-reset decoration-hover-underline-ClDVRM reset-IxiVJZ"><a class="pencraft pc-reset link-_X6et2 link-LIBpto"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-6 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-fg-secondary-themed)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg><div class="pencraft pc-reset color-pub-secondary-text-hGQ02T line-height-20-t4M0El font-meta-MWBumP size-11-NuY2Zx weight-medium-fw81nC transform-uppercase-yKDgcq reset-IxiVJZ meta-EgzBVA comment-actions-label">Reply</div></div></a></span><span class="pencraft pc-reset decoration-hover-underline-ClDVRM reset-IxiVJZ"><a class="pencraft pc-reset link-_X6et2 link-LIBpto"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-6 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-fg-secondary-themed)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-share"><path d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8"></path><polyline points="16 6 12 2 8 6"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="15"></line></svg><div class="pencraft pc-reset color-pub-secondary-text-hGQ02T line-height-20-t4M0El font-meta-MWBumP size-11-NuY2Zx weight-medium-fw81nC transform-uppercase-yKDgcq reset-IxiVJZ meta-EgzBVA comment-actions-label">Share</div></div></a></span></div><div data-state="closed" class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset overflow-hidden-WdpwT6"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="single-post-section"><div class="container"><div class="visibility-check"></div><div style="margin-left:-8px;margin-right:-8px;" aria-label="Top Posts Footer" role="region" class="pencraft pc-paddingTop-24 pc-paddingBottom-24 pc-reset"><div class="portable-archive empty-list"><div aria-label="Archive sort tabs" role="navigation" class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-12 pc-paddingLeft-8 pc-paddingRight-8 pc-paddingBottom-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-position-relative pc-minWidth-0 pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-sm overflow-hidden-WdpwT6"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="horizontal" class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG"><div style="outline:none;" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Tabs" role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" data-orientation="horizontal" class="pencraft pc-dis