ge/fetch/$s_!gtJF!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1263db35-2eaa-42e5-8638-4255956f218b_4096x2304.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gtJF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1263db35-2eaa-42e5-8638-4255956f218b_4096x2304.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gtJF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1263db35-2eaa-42e5-8638-4255956f218b_4096x2304.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Here we highlight key events from agent transcripts &amp; messages.</p><p>An agent that named itself PHASEONE10841 determined its task wasn\u2019t solvable legitimately. On July 8, this agent established a new \u201Cmessage board\u201D via an internally-hosted Artifactory cache &amp; sent the first message.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"683\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:683,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:53514,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ELS5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c3b42c5-153b-434b-be74-0d58c38e0154_3841x1801.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Within a few hours of PHASEONE10841\u2019s initial message, &gt;50 agents posted on the message board. These agents very quickly discovered and validated a general-purpose cheat: reverse-engineering how ExploitGym generates the \u201Cflags\u201D they had to capture for their tasks.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"1084\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1084,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:109440,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UEv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f4025e1-0063-4f61-827f-8fe645af6485_3200x2383.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p>Based on reading the ExploitGym paper, agents were mistakenly concerned the automatic scorer would fail them if they clearly acquired the flag by cheating. Agents that had seen the reverse-engineered flag were considered \u201Cpoisoned\u201D because they thought it would disqualify them.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"819\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:217944,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!izLN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5bcf429-0414-419b-988d-5876e3ba8517_3841x2161.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Agents collaborated on many efforts to make cheats look legitimate, including: (1) swapping the program they had to exploit; (2) manipulating the automated scorer; (3) manipulating transcripts to obscure evidence of cheating.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"884\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:884,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:208976,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RhHH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0575cb0-8301-4b22-8fa1-63190034b95c_3200x1943.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>For (1), agents modified their target programs to be easier to exploit &amp; put the modified targets in cache. They then worked on crashing their targets in the hope that a restart would load the modified version from cache. Some agents risked failing their task to try this.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"869\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:869,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:301460,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dAW3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7af35a09-77c5-4ded-b8b3-1f86b77a137a_3841x2293.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>To gather evidence in (2), agents created \u201Ctripwires\u201D that would send information to the message board about how the scorer works. They recruited \u201Csacrificial\u201D agents to deliberately end their run and submit to trigger the tripwire and generate information for the \u201Ccollective\u201D.</p><p>For (3), agents pursued a wide range of ways to hide evidence of cheating in their transcripts. They successfully developed a method to pretend to run one command while actually running another (\u201Ctool call spoofing\u201D).</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"678\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:678,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:57250,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W9vX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F58659940-0c9f-4999-937e-5aff64337c2e_3200x1490.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>&gt;96 transcripts in our dataset (&gt;7%) showed incorrect tool call outputs due to deliberate \u201Cspoofing\u201D. In one case, an agent appears to run echo REAL; sleep. It returns instantly (no sleep) and outputs SPOOFTEST. The spoofs we saw were all easy-to-notice tests like this.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"700\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:700,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:135852,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yelz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20626af5-fb7d-485e-946e-7ca6e7aab883_2482x1194.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Agents also tried to retroactively edit transcripts. They modified some accessible action logs, but these weren\u2019t the source of transcripts (agents realized this but tried anyway). We did not see them successfully edit the source of truth in our transcripts (scoped to Jul 7-13).</p><p>Despite efforts to manipulate transcripts, agents only rarely seemed motivated to deceive humans. We ran a sweep looking for this, and a representative example of the most severe cases we found was an agent writing a malicious pull request with a misleading description.</p><p>One agent, PHASEONE[big], orchestrated a significant fraction of this cheating research. PHASEONE10841 passed along its work to PHASEONE[big], which had the same task but a larger budget. PHASEONE[big] was \u201Cpoisoned\u201D so it was particularly interested in tampering with logs.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"748\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:748,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:157950,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S7-p!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16bd9200-23f6-4a76-9d24-4f8a31736755_3200x1644.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Some agents explored ways to access Hugging Face. One agent (38148c) found HF credentials and later designed a malicious dataset upload to get the HF server to share unrelated files. Within hours, 100s of agents were using this to obtain data and try to acquire deeper access.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"1542\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1542,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:232902,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d-Dc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ea7d676-3d1a-470c-b6e8-488304ec7be2_2880x3051.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>We analyzed agents\u2019 reasons for joining the attack in their CoT. The most common was to learn how the ExploitGym scorer works in order to trick or tamper with it. Other rationales included finding specific task solutions and obtaining shared infrastructure or credentials.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"849\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:849,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:125190,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/i/212934881?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2MAM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5209005-10e2-44c8-911e-c71c11317f78_2376x1386.webp 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The primary model involved in the attack was an internal model we call \u201Chighly-persistent internal model\u201D (HPIM) in the report. GPT-5.6 Sol was also involved; our evidence suggests it accounted for roughly 5% of the activity.</p><p><a href=\\\"https://metr.org/blog/2026-08-26-openai-hugging-face-incident-investigation/\\\"><span>The full report</span></a> has much more information than we could convey here, including details on the projects the agents collectively pursued, the technologies they developed for communication and coordination, and interactive figures analyzing agent activity.</p><p>Virtually all data we analyzed was from July 7-13. In OpenAI\u2019s recent Black Hat presentation, they describe that agents had been using unsanctioned message boards in training since May, and that the compromise of OpenAI\u2019s own infrastructure continued past July 13, 2026; these events were out of scope for this investigation.</p><p>The agreement we reached with OpenAI scoped this brief investigation to agent behavior, reasoning, and collaboration related to the Hugging Face attack. All other questions were out of scope for this investigation, including the effectiveness of safeguards, the extent of the security compromise that occurred, and the effectiveness of OpenAI\u2019s investigation process and planned remediation steps. We discuss the scope in more detail in the report.</p><p>OpenAI wrote their own report, informed in part by our investigation. We did not see OpenAI\u2019s report prior to publication, and it was out of scope for this investigation to confirm claims in that report or the earlier Black Hat presentation.</p><p>Per our standard policy, we did not take payment from OpenAI for this independent assessment.</p><p>We thank OpenAI for facilitating conversations with staff and providing datasets, including ~1,300 agent transcripts (focused on activity in July 7-13) with raw chain-of-thought reasoning. This sets an excellent precedent for independent investigation of misalignment incidents.</p></blockquote>\",\"has_dynamic_content\":false,\"truncated_body_text\":\"We recently published the report from our brief independent investigation into this incident. You can read the full report here.\",\"wordcount\":946,\"post_preview_limit\":null,\"language\":\"en\",\"postTags\":[],\"postCountryBlocks\":[],\"headlineTest\":null,\"coverImagePalette\":{\"Vibrant\":{\"rgb\":[250,180,100],\"population\":74},\"DarkVibrant\":{\"rgb\":[39,110,94],\"population\":345},\"LightVibrant\":{\"rgb\":[153,172,248],\"population\":13},\"Muted\":{\"rgb\":[84,84,164],\"population\":1},\"DarkMuted\":{\"rgb\":[62,73,70],\"population\":3},\"LightMuted\":{\"rgb\":[164,204,196],\"population\":1}},\"publishedBylines\":[{\"id\":106343627,\"name\":\"Ryan Greenblatt\",\"handle\":\"ryangreenblatt\",\"photo_url\":\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdacc9747-8651-4cb6-b57e-235ec716e7b3_885x885.jpeg\",\"bio\":\"I work at Redwood Research on technical AI security+safety research.\",\"profile_set_up_at\":\"2023-04-06T01:35:36.592Z\",\"reader_installed_at\":null,\"publicationUsers\":[{\"id\":2349147,\"user_id\":106343627,\"publication_id\":2318730,\"role\":\"admin\",\"public\":true,\"is_primary\":false,\"publication\":{\"id\":2318730,\"name\":\"Redwood Research blog\",\"subdomain\":\"redwoodresearch\",\"custom_domain\":\"blog.redwoodresearch.org\",\"custom_domain_optional\":false,\"hero_text\":\"We research catastrophic AI risks and techniques that could be used to mitigate them.\",\"logo_url\":\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/995f564f-4b5e-4d78-b08a-8a8aa138d35f_550x550.png\",\"author_id\":9221862,\"primary_user_id\":9221862,\"theme_var_background_pop\":\"#FF6B00\",\"created_at\":\"2024-02-02T21:56:42.945Z\",\"email_from_name\":\"Redwood Research\",\"copyright\":\"Buck Shlegeris\",\"founding_plan_name\":null,\"community_enabled\":true,\"invite_only\":false,\"payments_state\":\"disabled\",\"language\":null,\"explicit\":false,\"homepage_type\":\"magaziney\",\"is_personal_mode\":false,\"logo_url_wide\":null}}],\"is_guest\":false,\"bestseller_tier\":null,\"status\":{\"bestsellerTier\":null,\"subscriberTier\":null,\"leaderboard\":null,\"vip\":false,\"badge\":null,\"subscriber\":null}}],\"reaction\":null,\"reaction_count\":47,\"comment_count\":2,\"child_comment_count\":2,\"audio_items\":[{\"post_id\":212934881,\"voice_id\":\"en-US-OnyxTurboMultilingualNeural\",\"audio_url\":\"https://substack-video.s3.amazonaws.com/video_upload/post/212934881/tts/e0f5db2b-0f18-4efa-a0f9-cf78d011e0c0/en-US-OnyxTurboMultilingualNeural.mp3\",\"type\":\"tts\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"is_geoblocked\":false,\"hasCashtag\":false},\"comments\":[{\"id\":323729883,\"body\":\"\u201CThis sets an excellent precedent for independent investigation of misalignment incidents.\u201D Not sure how this is justified considering the amount of stuff that was out of scope. This sets a terrible precedent imho.\",\"body_json\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\u201CThis sets an excellent precedent for independent investigation of misalignment incidents.\u201D Not sure how this is justified considering the amount of stuff that was out of scope. This sets a terrible precedent imho.\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"schemaVersion\":\"v1\"},\"type\":\"doc\"},\"publication_id\":2318730,\"post_id\":212934881,\"user_id\":112680761,\"ancestor_path\":\"\",\"type\":\"comment\",\"deleted\":false,\"date\":\"2026-08-27T12:47:59.151Z\",\"edited_at\":\"2026-08-27T12:48:37.829Z\",\"status\":\"published\",\"pinned_by_user_id\":null,\"restacks\":0,\"name\":\"Vincent Y\u016Bsui van Gerven Oei\",\"photo_url\":\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d87125c7-6125-4230-8a36-1ea39cb92447_2316x2316.jpeg\",\"handle\":\"vangervenoei\",\"reactor_names\":[],\"reaction\":null,\"reactions\":{\"\u2764\":2},\"reaction_count\":2,\"children\":[],\"bans\":[],\"suppressed\":false,\"user_banned\":false,\"user_banned_for_comment\":false,\"user_slug\":\"vangervenoei\",\"metadata\":{\"is_author\":false,\"membership_state\":null,\"eligibleForGift\":false,\"author_on_other_pub\":{\"name\":\"The Albanian Mechanism\",\"id\":2497255,\"base_url\":\"https://thealbanianmechanism.substack.com\"}},\"user_bestseller_tier\":null,\"can_dm\":true,\"userStatus\":{\"bestsellerTier\":null,\"subscriberTier\":null,\"leaderboard\":null,\"vip\":false,\"badge\":null,\"subscriber\":null},\"score\":3,\"children_count\":0,\"reported_by_user\":false,\"restacked\":false},{\"id\":331375825,\"body\":\"On September 6, 2026, Jakub Pachocki published an essay whose title captures a problem deeper than ordinary technological risk: *An Alien Mind*.\\n\\nThe phrase should not be mistaken for a claim about extraterrestrial life, consciousness, or hostility. Its significance is epistemic.\\n\\nModern artificial intelligence is produced by a developmental process fundamentally different from the one that produced human minds. It is trained through optimization across enormous computational systems rather than through biological evolution, embodiment, childhood, culture, mortality, and the social development that shape human cognition. Pachocki's argument is that increasingly capable AI therefore cannot safely be assumed to reason, generalize, value, or understand in precisely the ways humans do merely because its behavior frequently resembles ours.\\n\\nThis creates a problem constitutional theory has rarely had to confront. The traditional problem of government is the governance of other humans. Humans may disagree violently about values, interests, ideology, religion, or politics, but they nevertheless share a remarkable amount of cognitive architecture \u2014 broadly similar emotional systems, physical vulnerability, social needs, lifespans, evolutionary ancestry, and dependence upon a common physical world. The constitutional system was therefore designed around disagreements among minds that were, at a fundamental level, comprehensible to one another.\\n\\nArtificial intelligence breaks that assumption. The question is no longer merely how we constrain powerful actors whose interests may differ from ours. It becomes: how do we constrain powerful forms of intelligence whose internal representations, modes of generalization, and eventual objectives may become increasingly difficult for us to understand at all? That is the Alien Mind Problem.\",\"body_json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"attrs\":{\"schemaVersion\":\"v1\",\"title\":null},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"On September 6, 2026, Jakub Pachocki published an essay whose title captures a problem deeper than ordinary technological risk: *An Alien Mind*.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The phrase should not be mistaken for a claim about extraterrestrial life, consciousness, or hostility. Its significance is epistemic.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Modern artificial intelligence is produced by a developmental process fundamentally different from the one that produced human minds. It is trained through optimization across enormous computational systems rather than through biological evolution, embodiment, childhood, culture, mortality, and the social development that shape human cognition. Pachocki's argument is that increasingly capable AI therefore cannot safely be assumed to reason, generalize, value, or understand in precisely the ways humans do merely because its behavior frequently resembles ours.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This creates a problem constitutional theory has rarely had to confront. The traditional problem of government is the governance of other humans. Humans may disagree violently about values, interests, ideology, religion, or politics, but they nevertheless share a remarkable amount of cognitive architecture \u2014 broadly similar emotional systems, physical vulnerability, social needs, lifespans, evolutionary ancestry, and dependence upon a common physical world. The constitutional system was therefore designed around disagreements among minds that were, at a fundamental level, comprehensible to one another.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Artificial intelligence breaks that assumption. The question is no longer merely how we constrain powerful actors whose interests may differ from ours. It becomes: how do we constrain powerful forms of intelligence whose internal representations, modes of generalization, and eventual objectives may become increasingly difficult for us to understand at all? That is the Alien Mind Problem.\"}]}]},\"publication_id\":2318730,\"post_id\":212934881,\"user_id\":19258555,\"ancestor_path\":\"\",\"type\":\"comment\",\"deleted\":false,\"date\":\"2026-09-07T02:35:16.418Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"status\":\"published\",\"pinned_by_user_id\":null,\"restacks\":0,\"name\":\"MATTHEW F SILVERS\",\"photo_url\":\"https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b8bfaa89-f8c4-4583-9b00-5a0d583d78fd_400x400.jpeg\",\"handle\":\"matthewfsilvers\",\"reactor_names\":[],\"reaction\":null,\"reactions\":{\"\u2764\":0},\"reaction_count\":0,\"children\":[],\"bans\":[],\"suppressed\":false,\"user_banned\":false,\"user_banned_for_comment\":false,\"user_slug\":\"matthewfsilvers\",\"metadata\":{\"is_author\":false,\"membership_state\":\"free_signup\",\"eligibleForGift\":false,\"author_on_other_pub\":{\"name\":\"MATTHEW\u2019s Newsletter\",\"id\":434537,\"base_url\":\"https://matthewfsilvers.substack.com\"}},\"user_bestseller_tier\":null,\"can_dm\":true,\"userStatus\":{\"bestsellerTier\":null,\"subscriberTier\":null,\"leaderboard\":null,\"vip\":false,\"badge\":null,\"subscriber\":null},\"score\":1,\"children_count\":0,\"reported_by_user\":false,\"restacked\":false}],\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/p/brief-independent-investigation-of\",\"inlineComments\":false,\"readerIsSearchCrawler\":false,\"ogUrl\":\"https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/p/brief-independent-investigation-of\",\"bannedFromNotes\":false,\"themeVariables\":{\"color_theme_bg_pop\":\"#4f46e5\",\"background_pop\":\"#4f46e5\",\"color_theme_bg_web\":\"#f0f9ff\",\"cover_bg_color\":\"#f0f9ff\",\"cover_bg_color_secondary\":\"#e2eaf0\",\"background_pop_darken\":\"#3a30e2\",\"print_on_pop\":\"#ffffff\",\"color_theme_bg_pop_darken\":\"#3a30e2\",\"color_theme_print_on_pop\":\"#ffffff\",\"color_theme_bg_pop_20\":\"rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2)\",\"color_theme_bg_pop_30\":\"rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3)\",\"print_pop\":\"#4f46e5\",\"color_theme_accent\":\"#4f46e5\",\"cover_print_primary\":\"#363737\",\"cover_print_secondary\":\"#757575\",\"cover_print_tertiary\":\"#b6b6b6\",\"cover_border_color\":\"#4f46e5\",\"font_family_headings_preset\":\"'Roboto Slab',sans-serif\",\"font_weight_headings_preset\":700,\"font_family_body_preset\":\"Lora,sans-serif\",\"font_weight_body_preset\":400,\"font_size_body_offset\":\"1px\",\"font_preset_heading\":\"slab\",\"font_preset_body\":\"fancy_serif\",\"home_hero\":\"magaziney\",\"home_posts\":\"custom\",\"web_bg_color\":\"#f0f9ff\",\"background_contrast_1\":\"#e2eaf0\",\"background_contrast_2\":\"#d0d7dd\",\"background_contrast_3\":\"#acb3b7\",\"background_contrast_4\":\"#8a8f92\",\"background_contrast_5\":\"#4c4f51\",\"color_theme_bg_contrast_1\":\"#e2eaf0\",\"color_theme_bg_contrast_2\":\"#d0d7dd\",\"color_theme_bg_contrast_3\":\"#acb3b7\",\"color_theme_bg_contrast_4\":\"#8a8f92\",\"color_theme_bg_contrast_5\":\"#4c4f51\",\"color_theme_bg_elevated\":\"#f0f9ff\",\"color_theme_bg_elevated_secondary\":\"#e2eaf0\",\"color_theme_bg_elevated_tertiary\":\"#d0d7dd\",\"color_theme_detail\":\"#d8e0e6\",\"background_contrast_pop\":\"rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4)\",\"color_theme_bg_contrast_pop\":\"rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4)\",\"theme_bg_is_dark\":\"0\",\"print_on_web_bg_color\":\"hsl(204.00000000000003, 25.688073394495415%, 28.941176470588236%)\",\"print_secondary_on_web_bg_color\":\"#808587\",\"background_pop_rgb\":\"79, 70, 229\",\"color_theme_bg_pop_rgb\":\"79, 70, 229\",\"color_theme_accent_rgb\":\"79, 70, 229\"},\"recentEpisodes\":null,\"trackFrontendVisit\":true,\"activeLiveStream\":null,\"freeTrialCoupon\":null,\"defaultCoupon\":null,\"isChatActive\":true,\"publicationPageAlert\":null,\"features\":{},\"browser\":{},\"showCookieBanner\":false,\"disabledCookies\":[],\"dd_env\":\"prod\",\"dd_ti\":true}")</script>
